{"sections":[{"slug":"Pfaff型","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Pfaff型"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Pfaff <span lang=\"zh\">型</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Pfaff 型”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Pfaff <span lang=\"zh\">型是偶数维反对称矩阵的一个函数</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">在</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/陈--Weil理论","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">陈</span>–Weil <span lang=\"zh\">理论</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中</span>, Pfaff <span lang=\"zh\">型对应</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Euler类","text":"Euler <span lang=\"zh\">类</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $A=(a_{ij})$ <span lang=\"zh\">是反对称矩阵</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">将其对应到</span> $2$-<span lang=\"zh\">向量</span> $\\omega = \\sum_{i&lt;j} a_{ij} e_i \\wedge e_j$, <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $\\operatorname{Pf}(A)$ <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span>\n$$\r\n\\frac{1}{n!}\\omega^n = \\operatorname{Pf}(A) e_1\\wedge\\cdots \\wedge e_n.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对反对称矩阵</span> $A$, $\\operatorname{Pf}(A)^2 = \\det (A)$. <span lang=\"zh\">对任意矩阵</span> $P$, $\\operatorname{Pf}(P^T AP) = \\det (P) \\operatorname{Pf}(A)$.</p>\n"}]}}}]}